function studentDetailTabs(){const tabs=[['academic','book','Academic History'],['fees','payment','Fees'],['exam','certificate','Exam'],['document','file','Document'],['timetable','calendar','Class Time Table'],['attendance','attendance','Attendance'],['summary','student','Summary Student Information']];return `<nav class="student-profile-tabs">${tabs.map(([key,icon,label])=>`<button type="button" class="${state.studentDetailTab===key?'active':''}" data-student-tab="${key}">${iconSvg(icon,'sr-icon tab-icon')}${label}</button>`).join('')}</nav>`}
function studentAcademicTab(student){return `<section class="student-tab-card"><header><h3>⚙ Academic History</h3><div class="student-tab-search"><button type="button" class="btn primary" id="setStudentMobilePassword">Set Mobile Password</button><span>◉ ទិន្នន័យសិស្ស</span><input placeholder="ស្វែងរក"><button>⌕</button></div></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Time</th><th>Class</th><th>Ranking</th><th>Score</th><th>Grade</th><th>Other</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>${esc(student.time||'Morning(7:30AM - 11:00AM)')}</td><td>${esc(student.class||'—')}</td><td>▪</td><td>${esc(student.score||'')}</td><td>${esc(student.grade||'')}</td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer></section>`}
function studentFeesTab(student){const list=state.payments.filter(p=>String(p.student_id||p.student||'')===String(student.id));const total=list.reduce((a,p)=>a+(Number(p.amount)||0),0);return `<section class="student-tab-card"><header><h3>⚙ Fees</h3><div class="student-tab-search"><span>◉ ទិន្នន័យសិស្ស</span><input placeholder="ស្វែងរក"><button>⌕</button></div></header>${list.length?list.map((p,i)=>`<article class="student-fee-record"><div><b>${esc(p.invoice||`INV${String(i+1).padStart(6,'0')}`)}</b><small>${esc(String(p.paid_at||p.date||'').slice(0,10)||'—')}</small></div><span><small>Total</small><b class="green">$${Number(p.amount||0).toFixed(2)}</b></span><span><small>Paid</small><b class="orange">$${Number(p.amount||0).toFixed(2)}</b></span><span><small>Remaining</small><b class="green">Paid</b></span><button type="button" class="student-view-transactions" data-fee-expand="${i}">◉ View Transactions</button><div class="student-fee-transactions" data-fee-panel="${i}" hidden><button type="button" class="fee-detail-label">☷ Fee Details</button><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Receipt</th><th>Date</th><th>Method</th><th>Currency</th><th>Amount</th><th>Note</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>1</td><td>${esc(p.receipt||`RCP${String(i+1).padStart(6,'0')}`)}</td><td>${esc(String(p.paid_at||p.date||'').slice(0,10)||'—')}</td><td>${esc(p.method||'Cash')}</td><td>USD</td><td><b class="green">$${Number(p.amount||0).toFixed(2)}</b></td><td>${esc(p.note||'-')}</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></article>`).join(''):`<div class="student-empty-tab">No fee transactions found for this student.</div>`}<footer>Page 1 Of 1 ${list.length?`<span>Total paid: $${total.toFixed(2)}</span>`:''}</footer></section>`}
function studentExamTab(student){const exams=(state.records?.['student-exam-'+student.id]||[]);return `<section class="student-tab-card"><header><h3>⚙ Exam</h3><div class="student-tab-search"><span>◉ ទិន្នន័យសិស្ស</span><input placeholder="ស្វែងរក"><button>⌕</button></div></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Subject</th><th>Exam Score</th><th>Score</th><th>Grade</th><th>Pass/Fail</th><th>Other</th></tr></thead><tbody>${exams.length?exams.map((r,i)=>`<tr><td>${i+1}</td><td>${esc(r.subject||'')}</td><td>${esc(r.exam||'')}</td><td>${esc(r.score||'')}</td><td>${esc(r.grade||'')}</td><td>${esc(r.result||'')}</td><td>${esc(r.other||'')}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="7" class="empty">No exam results recorded.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer></section>`}
function studentDocumentTab(student){const docs=studentDetailDocuments(student.id);return `<section class="student-tab-card"><header><h3>⚙ Document</h3><div class="student-tab-search"><span>◉ ទិន្នន័យសិស្ស</span><input placeholder="ស្វែងរក"><button>⌕</button></div></header><div class="student-doc-actions"><button type="button" id="uploadStudentDocument">＋ Upload Documents</button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>ID</th><th>Title</th><th>Document</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${docs.length?docs.map((d,i)=>`<tr><td>${i+1}</td><td>${esc(d.title)}</td><td><a href="${d.data}" download="${esc(d.name)}">${esc(d.name)}</a></td><td><button type="button" class="student-doc-delete" data-doc="${i}">Delete</button></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">No documents uploaded</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer><div id="studentDocumentModal" class="student-doc-modal" hidden><div class="student-doc-dialog"><header><h3>Upload Documents</h3><button type="button" id="closeStudentDoc">×</button></header><form id="studentDocForm"><label>Title<input name="title" required></label><label>Document<input type="file" name="document" required></label><footer><button type="button" id="cancelStudentDoc">Close</button><button type="submit">Upload</button></footer></form></div></div></section>`}
function studentTimetableTemplate(student){const school=schoolIdentityData(),logo=school.logo||school.invoiceLogo;return `<article class="student-timetable-sheet"><header><div class="student-timetable-title"><img src="${esc(logo)}" alt="School logo"><h2>Teaching Schedule for Academic Year 2025-2026</h2><b>Branch: ${esc(student.branch||'SC1')}</b></div><p>${schoolContactLineMarkup('student-timetable-contact')}</p><div class="student-timetable-meta"><strong>Class: ${esc(student.class||'—')}</strong><span>${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}</span></div></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Teacher</th><th>TA</th><th>Mon</th><th>Tue</th><th>Wed</th><th>Thu</th><th>Fri</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class="student-break"><th>7:00-7:30<br>12:50-1:20</th><td colspan="7">Snack Lineup</td></tr><tr><th>7:40-8:30<br>1:40-2:30</th><td><b>Testing Teacher</b></td><td></td><td>Reading</td><td>Writing</td><td>Speaking</td><td>Writing</td><td>Writing</td></tr><tr class="student-break"><th>8:30-8:45<br>2:30-2:45</th><td colspan="7">Break-Time</td></tr><tr><th>8:45-9:30<br>2:45-3:30</th><td><b>Testing Teacher</b></td><td></td><td>Reading</td><td>Writing</td><td>Speaking</td><td>Writing</td><td>Writing</td></tr><tr class="student-break"><th>9:30-9:45<br>3:30-3:45</th><td colspan="7">Break-Time</td></tr><tr><th>9:45-10:00<br>3:45-4:30</th><td><b>Testing Teacher</b></td><td></td><td>Writing</td><td>Writing</td><td>Writing</td><td>Reading</td><td>Speaking</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="student-timetable-notices"><div><b>Notices:</b><p>* This schedule may be updated when required.</p><p>* Homework is assigned based on the academic program.</p><p>* Please follow classroom and school rules.</p></div><div><p>* 课程安排如有需要可随时调整。</p><p>* 请遵守课堂和学校规定。</p></div></div></article>`}
function studentTimetableTab(student){return `<section class="student-tab-card student-timetable-card"><div class="student-print-row"><button type="button" id="studentTimetablePrint" class="system-icon-button">${iconSvg('print','sr-icon action-icon')}<span>Print</span></button></div>${studentTimetableTemplate(student)}<footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer><div id="studentTimetablePrintModal" class="student-timetable-print-modal" hidden><div class="student-timetable-print-dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Teaching schedule print preview"><header class="student-timetable-print-head"><div><strong>${iconSvg('print','sr-icon')} Print Preview</strong><small>Only the teaching schedule template below will be printed.</small></div><div><button type="button" id="closeStudentTimetablePreview" class="system-icon-button secondary">${iconSvg('disable','sr-icon action-icon')}<span>Close</span></button><button type="button" id="studentTimetablePrintNow" class="system-icon-button primary">${iconSvg('print','sr-icon action-icon')}<span>Print Template</span></button></div></header><div class="student-timetable-print-preview">${studentTimetableTemplate(student)}</div></div></div></section>`}
function studentAttendanceTab(student){const pct=Number(student.attendance||0),presence=Math.max(0,Math.round(pct)),absent=Math.max(0,100-presence);return `<section class="student-tab-card"><header><h3>⚙ Attendance</h3><div class="student-tab-search"><span>◉ ទិន្នន័យសិស្ស</span><input placeholder="ស្វែងរក"><button>⌕</button></div></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Student Name</th><th>Class</th><th>Total Late</th><th>Total Absent</th><th>Total Permission</th><th>Total Presence</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>${esc(student.name)}</td><td>${esc(student.class||'—')}</td><td>0</td><td>${absent}</td><td>0</td><td>${presence}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer></section>`}
function studentSummaryTab(student){const year='2025 - 2026';return `<section class="student-summary-card"><header><div class="student-summary-photo">${student.photo?`<img src="${esc(student.photo)}" alt="${esc(student.name)}">`:iconSvg('user','student-summary-user')}</div><div><h2>${esc(student.name)}</h2><dl><div><dt>ឆ្នាំសិក្សា:</dt><dd>${year}</dd></div><div><dt>ថ្នាក់:</dt><dd>${esc(student.class||'—')}</dd></div><div><dt>ភេទ:</dt><dd>${esc(student.gender||'—')}</dd></div><div><dt>ទូរស័ព្ទ:</dt><dd>${esc(student.phone||'—')}</dd></div></dl></div></header><div class="student-summary-grid"><section><h3>ស្ថិតិវត្តមាន</h3><div class="summary-stat-grid"><span><b>${Number(student.attendance||0)}</b><small>វត្តមាន</small></span><span><b>0</b><small>អវត្តមាន</small></span><span><b>0</b><small>យឺត</small></span><span><b>0</b><small>ច្បាប់</small></span></div><h3>ព័ត៌មានសិក្សា</h3><dl class="summary-lines"><div><dt>ថ្នាក់:</dt><dd>${esc(student.class||'—')}</dd></div><div><dt>កម្មវិធី:</dt><dd>${esc(student.program||'General Education')}</dd></div><div><dt>វេន:</dt><dd>${esc(student.time||'Morning')}</dd></div></dl><h3>ស្ថានភាព</h3><dl class="summary-lines"><div><dt>សិក្សា:</dt><dd><span class="student-status-pill active">${student.status==='Active'?'កំពុងសិក្សា':'ផ្អាក'}</span></dd></div></dl></section><section><h3>ព័ត៌មានឪពុកម្តាយ</h3><dl class="summary-lines"><div><dt>ឪពុក:</dt><dd>${esc(student.father_name||student.guardian||'N/A')}</dd></div><div><dt>ទូរស័ព្ទ:</dt><dd>${esc(student.father_phone||student.phone||'N/A')}</dd></div><div><dt>ម្តាយ:</dt><dd>${esc(student.mother_name||'N/A')}</dd></div><div><dt>ទូរស័ព្ទ:</dt><dd>${esc(student.mother_phone||'N/A')}</dd></div></dl><h3>កំណត់ចំណាំ</h3><div class="summary-note">${esc(student.note||'...')}</div><div class="summary-signatures"><span>____________<small>Class Teacher</small></span><span>____________<small>Principal</small></span><span>____________<small>Parent</small></span></div></section></div></section>`}
function studentDetailProfileView(){const student=selectedStudent();if(!student)return `<div class="empty">No student selected. <button data-go="students">Back</button></div>`;const view={academic:studentAcademicTab,fees:studentFeesTab,exam:studentExamTab,document:studentDocumentTab,timetable:studentTimetableTab,attendance:studentAttendanceTab,summary:studentSummaryTab}[state.studentDetailTab]||studentAcademicTab;return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>⚙ Student Management List</span><i>/</i><span>◉ Detail information</span><button type="button" data-go="students">← Back</button></div><div class="student-profile-layout">${studentProfileSide(student)}<main class="student-profile-main">${studentDetailTabs()}${view(student)}</main></div>`}

function importStudentsView(){return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>Student Information</span><i>/</i><span>Import Student</span></div><section class="student-import-panel"><header><span>⇧</span><h1>Import Student</h1></header><form id="studentImportForm"><label>Select Branch <em>*</em><select name="branch" required><option value="">-- Choose Branch --</option><option>SC1</option></select></label><label class="student-import-file">Student File <em>*</em><input id="studentImportFile" type="file" accept=".csv" required><span>Choose CSV file</span></label><div class="student-import-actions"><button type="button" id="downloadStudentTemplate">⇩ Download Template</button><button type="submit">⇧ Import Students</button></div></form></section>`}
function pendingStudentsView(){const rows=state.admissions.filter(record=>record.status!=='Enrolled');return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>Student Information</span><i>/</i><span>Pending Students</span></div><section class="pending-students-panel"><header><span>◷</span><h1>Pending Students</h1></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Admission No</th><th>Student Name</th><th>Class</th><th>Section</th><th>Gender</th><th>Mobile Number</th><th>Date</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.length?rows.map((record,index)=>`<tr><td>${index+1}</td><td>ADM-${String(record.id).padStart(5,'0')}</td><td>${esc(record.student_name)}</td><td>${esc(record.requested_class||'')}</td><td>${esc(record.section||'')}</td><td>${esc(record.gender||'')}</td><td>${esc(record.phone||'')}</td><td>${String(record.created_at||'').slice(0,10)}</td><td><span class="badge warn">${esc(record.status)}</span></td><td><button type="button" class="pending-detail" data-id="${record.id}">${iconSvg('eye','sr-icon action-icon')} View Detail</button></td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="10" class="empty">No pending students.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section>`}
function pendingStudentDetailView(){
 const record=state.admissions.find(item=>String(item.id)===String(state.pendingAdmissionId));
 if(!record)return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>Pending Students</span><i>/</i><span>Admission Review</span><button type="button" data-go="student-pending">← Back</button></div><section class="pending-review-empty"><h2>Admission record not found</h2><p>Return to Pending Students and choose View Detail again.</p></section>`;
 const code=`IIS.${String(record.id).padStart(3,'0')}`;
 const matchingStudent=state.students.find(st=>String(st.phone||'').replace(/\D/g,'')===String(record.phone||'').replace(/\D/g,'')||String(st.name||'').trim().toLowerCase()===String(record.student_name||'').trim().toLowerCase());
 const payments=matchingStudent?state.payments.filter(p=>String(p.student_id)===String(matchingStudent.id)):[];
 const paymentRows=payments.length?payments.map((p,index)=>`<tr><td>${esc(p.receipt||`INV${String(index+1).padStart(6,'0')}`)}</td><td>${esc(String(p.paid_at||'').slice(0,10)||'—')}</td><td>${money(Number(p.amount)||0)}</td><td>${money(Number(p.amount)||0)}</td><td>${money(0)}</td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="5" class="pending-review-no-data">No payment information on file.</td></tr>`;
 const guardianName=record.guardian||matchingStudent?.guardian_name||matchingStudent?.guardian||'';
 const guardianPhone=matchingStudent?.guardian_phone||record.phone||'';
 const parentBlock=(guardianName||guardianPhone)?`<div class="pending-guardian-grid"><div><span>Guardian Name</span><b>${esc(guardianName||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Guardian Phone</span><b>${esc(guardianPhone||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Relation</span><b>${esc(matchingStudent?.guardian_relation||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Address</span><b>${esc(matchingStudent?.guardian_address||'—')}</b></div></div>`:`<p class="pending-review-no-data">No parent/guardian information on file.</p>`;
 const reviewStatus=record.status||'Pending Review';
 const reviewDate=record.reviewed_date?new Date(record.reviewed_date).toLocaleString():'—';
 return `<div class="front-breadcrumb pending-review-breadcrumb"><span>${iconSvg('home','sr-icon')}</span><span>Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>${iconSvg('users','sr-icon')}</span><span>Pending Students</span><i>/</i><span>${iconSvg('eye','sr-icon')}</span><span>Admission Review</span><button type="button" id="pendingBack">← Back</button></div>
 <div class="pending-review-layout">
  <main class="pending-review-main">
   <section class="pending-review-card"><header>Student Profile</header><div class="pending-review-lines">
    <div><span>Admission No</span><b>${code}</b></div><div><span>Name (English)</span><b>${esc(record.name_english||record.student_name||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Name (Khmer)</span><b>${esc(record.name_khmer||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Gender</span><b>${esc(record.gender||matchingStudent?.gender||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Date of Birth</span><b>${esc(record.birth_date||matchingStudent?.birth_date||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Mobile Number</span><b>${esc(record.phone||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Registration Date</span><b>${esc(String(record.created_at||'').slice(0,10)||'—')}</b></div>
   </div></section>
   <section class="pending-review-card"><header>Program / Level / Class</header><div class="pending-review-lines"><div><span>Program</span><b>${esc(record.program||matchingStudent?.program||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Class / Level</span><b>${esc(record.requested_class||matchingStudent?.class||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Section</span><b>${esc(record.section||matchingStudent?.time||'—')}</b></div></div></section>
   <section class="pending-review-card"><header>Parent / Guardian Information</header>${parentBlock}</section>
   <section class="pending-review-card"><header>Payment Information</header><div class="table-scroll"><table class="pending-payment-table"><thead><tr><th>Invoice No</th><th>Payment Date</th><th>Grand Total</th><th>Amount Paid</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody>${paymentRows}</tbody></table></div></section>
  </main>
  <aside class="pending-review-side"><section class="pending-review-card pending-review-action-card"><header>Admission Review</header><div class="pending-review-summary"><div><span>Status</span><b><em class="pending-status-pill ${String(reviewStatus).toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,'-')}">${esc(reviewStatus==='Inquiry'?'Pending Review':reviewStatus)}</em></b></div><div><span>Reviewed By</span><b>${esc(record.reviewed_by||'—')}</b></div><div><span>Reviewed Date</span><b>${esc(reviewDate)}</b></div><div><span>Remark</span><b>${esc(record.remark||'—')}</b></div></div><div class="pending-review-controls"><button type="button" id="pendingApprove" class="pending-approve">${iconSvg('enable','sr-icon action-icon')} Approve</button><label>Remark <small>(required for Reject / Request Update)</small><textarea id="pendingReviewRemark" rows="4" placeholder="Enter review remark...">${esc(record.remark||'')}</textarea></label><button type="button" id="pendingRequestUpdate" class="pending-update">${iconSvg('edit','sr-icon action-icon')} Request Update</button><button type="button" id="pendingReject" class="pending-reject">${iconSvg('delete','sr-icon action-icon')} Reject</button></div></section></aside>
 </div>`;
}

function bindStudentInformation(){
 document.querySelectorAll('.student-detail-more').forEach(button=>button.onclick=e=>{e.stopPropagation();const menu=button.nextElementSibling,opening=menu.hidden;document.querySelectorAll('.student-detail-menu').forEach(item=>item.hidden=true);menu.hidden=!opening});
 const filterDetails=()=>{const search=$('#studentDetailsSearch');if(!search)return;const query=search.value.toLowerCase(),className=$('#detailClass')?.value||'',time=$('#detailTime')?.value||'';let visible=0;document.querySelectorAll('#studentDetailsRows tr[data-search]').forEach(row=>{const show=row.dataset.search.includes(query)&&(!className||row.dataset.class===className)&&(!time||String(row.dataset.time||'').toLowerCase().includes(time.toLowerCase()));row.hidden=!show;if(show)visible++});$('#studentDetailsInfo').textContent=`Showing ${visible?'1':'0'} to ${visible} of ${visible} ${visible===1?'entry':'entries'}`};
 if($('#studentDetailsSearch')){$('#studentDetailsSearch').oninput=filterDetails;$('#detailClass').onchange=filterDetails;$('#detailProgram').onchange=filterDetails;$('#detailTime').onchange=filterDetails}
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.selectedStudentId=b.dataset.detail;state.studentDetailTab='academic';localStorage.setItem('scschool.selectedStudentId',state.selectedStudentId);navigate('student-detail-view')});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-pay]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.collectFeeStudentId=b.dataset.pay;navigate('finance')});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-edit]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.editingStudentId=b.dataset.edit;navigate('student-edit')});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-enable]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const st=state.students.find(x=>String(x.id)===String(b.dataset.enable));if(!st)return;st.status=st.status==='Active'?'Inactive':'Active';persist();render();toast(st.status==='Active'?'Student enabled':'Student disabled')});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-delete-detail]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=async()=>{if(!confirm('Delete this student?'))return;const id=b.dataset.deleteDetail;try{if(state.server)await api('delete-student',{id});state.students=state.students.filter(x=>String(x.id)!==String(id));persist();render();toast('Student deleted')}catch(error){toast(error.message)}});
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-student-tab]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{state.studentDetailTab=b.dataset.studentTab;render()});
 const mobilePasswordButton=$('#setStudentMobilePassword');if(mobilePasswordButton)mobilePasswordButton.onclick=async()=>{if(!student)return;const password=prompt(`Set a temporary mobile password for ${student.name} (minimum 8 characters):`);if(password===null)return;if(password.length<8)return toast('Password must be at least 8 characters');const confirmation=prompt('Enter the same password again:');if(password!==confirmation)return toast('Passwords do not match');try{await api('mobile-account',{student_id:student.id,password,must_change_password:true,active:true});toast(`Mobile login enabled for ${student.id}`)}catch(error){toast(error.message)}};
 const timetableModal=$('#studentTimetablePrintModal');
 if($('#studentTimetablePrint'))$('#studentTimetablePrint').onclick=()=>{if(timetableModal){timetableModal.hidden=false;document.body.classList.add('student-timetable-preview-open')}};
 if($('#closeStudentTimetablePreview'))$('#closeStudentTimetablePreview').onclick=()=>{if(timetableModal){timetableModal.hidden=true;document.body.classList.remove('student-timetable-preview-open')}};
 if($('#studentTimetablePrintNow'))$('#studentTimetablePrintNow').onclick=()=>{document.body.classList.add('student-timetable-template-printing');try{window.print()}finally{setTimeout(()=>document.body.classList.remove('student-timetable-template-printing'),300)}};
 if(timetableModal)timetableModal.onclick=e=>{if(e.target===timetableModal){timetableModal.hidden=true;document.body.classList.remove('student-timetable-preview-open')}};
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-fee-expand]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const panel=document.querySelector(`[data-fee-panel="${b.dataset.feeExpand}"]`);if(panel)panel.hidden=!panel.hidden});
 const student=selectedStudent();const modal=$('#studentDocumentModal');if($('#uploadStudentDocument'))$('#uploadStudentDocument').onclick=()=>modal.hidden=false;if($('#closeStudentDoc'))$('#closeStudentDoc').onclick=()=>modal.hidden=true;if($('#cancelStudentDoc'))$('#cancelStudentDoc').onclick=()=>modal.hidden=true;
 if($('#studentDocForm'))$('#studentDocForm').onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();const file=e.currentTarget.document.files?.[0],title=e.currentTarget.title.value.trim();if(!file||!title)return;const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>{const docs=studentDetailDocuments(student.id);docs.push({title,name:file.name,type:file.type,data:String(reader.result)});if(!saveStudentDetailDocuments(student.id,docs))return toast('Document is too large to store in this browser');toast('Document uploaded');render()};reader.readAsDataURL(file)};
 document.querySelectorAll('.student-doc-delete').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{if(!student)return;const docs=studentDetailDocuments(student.id);docs.splice(Number(b.dataset.doc),1);saveStudentDetailDocuments(student.id,docs);render();toast('Document deleted')});
 if($('#downloadStudentTemplate'))$('#downloadStudentTemplate').onclick=()=>{const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob(['id,name,class,guardian,phone,status\nST-0001,Student Name,KGE-K1,Guardian Name,012345678,Active'],{type:'text/csv'}));a.download='student-import-template.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)};
 if($('#studentImportForm'))$('#studentImportForm').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const file=$('#studentImportFile').files[0];if(!file)return toast('Choose a CSV file');const lines=(await file.text()).split(/\r?\n/).filter(Boolean),headers=lines.shift().split(',').map(value=>value.trim().toLowerCase());let imported=0;for(const line of lines){const values=line.split(','),data=Object.fromEntries(headers.map((header,index)=>[header,(values[index]||'').trim()])),st={id:data.id||`ST-${Date.now().toString().slice(-7)}-${imported}`,name:data.name||'',class:data.class||'Unassigned',guardian:data.guardian||data.name||'',phone:data.phone||'',status:data.status||'Active',balance:0,attendance:100};if(!st.name)continue;try{if(state.server)await api('student',st);state.students.unshift(st);imported++}catch(error){toast(`Row ${imported+2}: ${error.message}`)}}persist();if(state.server)await refreshServer();toast(`${imported} students imported`);navigate('students')};
 document.querySelectorAll('.pending-detail').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{state.pendingAdmissionId=button.dataset.id;persist();navigate('student-pending-detail')});
 const pendingBack=$('#pendingBack');if(pendingBack)pendingBack.onclick=()=>navigate('student-pending');
 const submitReview=async(status)=>{const record=state.admissions.find(item=>String(item.id)===String(state.pendingAdmissionId));if(!record)return toast('Admission record not found');const remark=($('#pendingReviewRemark')?.value||'').trim();if((status==='Rejected'||status==='Update Requested')&&!remark)return toast('Remark is required for Reject or Request Update');try{const payload={id:Number(record.id),status,remark,reviewed_by:'Super Admin'};if(state.server)await api('admission-review',payload);Object.assign(record,{status,remark,reviewed_by:'Super Admin',reviewed_date:new Date().toISOString()});persist();if(state.server)await refreshServer();toast(status==='Approved'?'Admission approved':status==='Rejected'?'Admission rejected':'Update requested');render()}catch(error){toast(error.message)}};
 if($('#pendingApprove'))$('#pendingApprove').onclick=()=>submitReview('Approved');
 if($('#pendingRequestUpdate'))$('#pendingRequestUpdate').onclick=()=>submitReview('Update Requested');
 if($('#pendingReject'))$('#pendingReject').onclick=()=>submitReview('Rejected')
}
function dashboardView(){
  const transactions=state.payments.length||6;
  const staffs=(state.records?.employees||state.records?.staff||[]).length||3;
  const students=state.students.length||9;
  const newStudents=state.admissions.filter(x=>x.status==='Enrolled').length||1;
  const attendanceValues=Object.values(state.attendance||{});
  const attendanceRate=attendanceValues.length?Math.round(attendanceValues.filter(Boolean).length/attendanceValues.length*100):92;
  const today=new Date();
  const currentDate=today.toLocaleDateString(undefined,{weekday:'long',year:'numeric',month:'long',day:'numeric'});
  const score=Math.min(100,Math.max(70,Math.round(80+(students%13))));
  const completion=Math.min(100,Math.round((newStudents/Math.max(students,1))*100)+76);
  const monthKey=date=>{const d=new Date(date);return Number.isNaN(d.getTime())?'':`${d.getFullYear()}-${String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}`};
  const currentMonth=`${today.getFullYear()}-${String(today.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}`;
  const previousDate=new Date(today.getFullYear(),today.getMonth()-1,1);
  const previousMonth=`${previousDate.getFullYear()}-${String(previousDate.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}`;
  const paymentIncome=month=>state.payments.filter(p=>monthKey(p.paid_at||p.date)===month).reduce((sum,p)=>sum+(Number(p.amount)||0),0);
  const journals=state.records?.['accounting-journal']||[];
  const journalTotal=(month,type)=>journals.filter(row=>monthKey(row.Date)===month&&String(row['Operation Type']||'').toLowerCase()===type).reduce((sum,row)=>sum+(Number(type==='income'?row['Total Credit']:row['Total Debit'])||0),0);
  const localSummary={income_this_month:paymentIncome(currentMonth)+journalTotal(currentMonth,'income'),income_last_month:paymentIncome(previousMonth)+journalTotal(previousMonth,'income'),expense_this_month:journalTotal(currentMonth,'expense')};
  const summary=state.financeSummary||localSummary;
  const incomeThisMonth=Number(summary.income_this_month)||0;
  const incomeLastMonth=Number(summary.income_last_month)||0;
  const expenseThisMonth=Number(summary.expense_this_month)||0;
  const profitThisMonth=summary.profit_this_month===undefined?incomeThisMonth-expenseThisMonth:Number(summary.profit_this_month)||0;
  const summaryCurrency=String(summary.currency||currencyCode()).toUpperCase();
  const dashboardUsd=value=>summaryCurrency==='USD'?Number(value||0):convertCurrency(value,summaryCurrency,'USD');
  const quick=[
    ['student','Student Information','Manage admissions and student records','students','Open Students'],
    ['attendance','Attendance','Check daily attendance and leaves','attendance-log','View Attendance'],
    ['payment','Payment Process','Collect fees and review transactions','finance','Collect Fees'],
    ['report','Reports','View school performance and finance','reports','Open Reports']
  ];
  return `<section class="neo-dashboard">
    <div class="neo-dashboard-head">
      <div>
        <p>Dashboard / Overview</p>
        <h1>Welcome Back, <strong data-current-user-name>${esc(signedInDisplayName())}</strong> <span>👋</span></h1>
        <small>${esc(currentDate)}</small>
      </div>
      <label class="neo-search">${iconSvg('search','sr-icon')}<input type="search" placeholder="Search dashboard..." aria-label="Search dashboard"></label>
    </div>

    <section class="neo-hero">
      <div class="neo-hero-copy">
        <span class="neo-kicker">WG SYSTEM</span>
        <h2>Smart school management, all in one place.</h2>
        <p>Track students, staff, payments, attendance and reports from one clear dashboard.</p>
        <div class="neo-hero-actions">
          <button type="button" data-go="student-admission">${iconSvg('add','sr-icon')} Register Student</button>
          <button type="button" class="ghost" data-go="reports">${iconSvg('report','sr-icon')} View Reports</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="neo-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="neo-orbit orbit-one"></div>
        <div class="neo-orbit orbit-two"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-quick-grid">
      ${quick.map(([icon,title,desc,page,action])=>`<article class="neo-quick-card">
        <div class="neo-quick-icon">${iconSvg(icon,'sr-icon')}</div>
        <div><h3>${title}</h3><p>${desc}</p></div>
        <button type="button" data-go="${page}">${action} <span>→</span></button>
      </article>`).join('')}
    </section>

    <section class="neo-metrics">
      <header><div><h2>Performance Overview</h2><p>Live summary from your school system</p></div><span>This Month</span></header>
      <div class="neo-metric-grid">
        <article><i>${iconSvg('payment','sr-icon')}</i><div><strong>${transactions}</strong><span>Total Transactions</span></div><em>↑ 20%</em></article>
        <article><i>${iconSvg('hr','sr-icon')}</i><div><strong>${staffs}</strong><span>Total Staffs</span></div><em>↑ 5%</em></article>
        <article><i>${iconSvg('student','sr-icon')}</i><div><strong>${students}</strong><span>Total Students</span></div><em>↑ 12%</em></article>
        <article><i>${iconSvg('academic','sr-icon')}</i><div><strong>${score}%</strong><span>Average Score</span></div><em>↑ 8%</em></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-finance-grid" aria-label="Dashboard financial summary">
      <article class="neo-finance-card income-last"><div class="neo-finance-icon">${iconSvg('report','sr-icon')}</div><div><span>Income Last Month</span><strong>${money(dashboardUsd(incomeLastMonth),'USD')}</strong><small>Previous month collection</small></div></article>
      <article class="neo-finance-card income-current"><div class="neo-finance-icon">${iconSvg('payment','sr-icon')}</div><div><span>Income This Month</span><strong>${money(dashboardUsd(incomeThisMonth),'USD')}</strong><small>Current month collection</small></div></article>
      <article class="neo-finance-card expense"><div class="neo-finance-icon">${iconSvg('accounting','sr-icon')}</div><div><span>Expense</span><strong>${money(dashboardUsd(expenseThisMonth),'USD')}</strong><small>Current month expenses</small></div></article>
      <article class="neo-finance-card profit"><div class="neo-finance-icon">${iconSvg('dashboard','sr-icon')}</div><div><span>Profit</span><strong>${money(dashboardUsd(profitThisMonth),'USD')}</strong><small>Income minus expenses</small></div></article>
    </section>

    <section class="neo-dashboard-lower">
      <article class="neo-panel neo-trend">
        <header><div><h2>School Performance Trend</h2><p>Student activity and collection overview</p></div><span>Last 30 days</span></header>
        <div class="neo-chart-wrap">
          <div class="neo-y-axis"><span>100</span><span>75</span><span>50</span><span>25</span><span>0</span></div>
          <svg class="neo-line-chart" viewBox="0 0 760 250" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="img" aria-label="School performance trend">
            <defs><linearGradient id="neoArea" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#2563eb" stop-opacity=".28"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#2563eb" stop-opacity=".02"/></linearGradient></defs>
            <path class="neo-gridline" d="M0 25H760M0 80H760M0 135H760M0 190H760M0 245H760"/>
            <path class="neo-area" d="M0 210 C80 185 120 165 175 170 S290 210 350 140 S465 112 520 120 S640 92 760 52 L760 250 L0 250 Z"/>
            <path class="neo-line" d="M0 210 C80 185 120 165 175 170 S290 210 350 140 S465 112 520 120 S640 92 760 52"/>
            <circle cx="350" cy="140" r="5"/><circle cx="520" cy="120" r="5"/><circle cx="760" cy="52" r="5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="neo-x-axis"><span>1 Aug</span><span>5 Aug</span><span>10 Aug</span><span>15 Aug</span><span>20 Aug</span><span>25 Aug</span><span>Today</span></div>
      </article>

      <article class="neo-panel neo-profile-card">
        <header><h2>School Profile</h2></header>
        <div class="neo-profile-main">
          <div class="neo-profile-logo">${systemLogoMarkup('neo-system-logo')}</div>
          <h3>WG SYSTEM</h3>
          <p>School Management System</p>
        </div>
        <div class="neo-progress-label"><span>Profile Completion</span><b>${completion}%</b></div>
        <div class="neo-progress"><i style="width:${completion}%"></i></div>
        <dl><div><dt>Students</dt><dd>${students}</dd></div><div><dt>Staff</dt><dd>${staffs}</dd></div><div><dt>Attendance</dt><dd>${attendanceRate}%</dd></div></dl>
      </article>

      <article class="neo-panel neo-subjects">
        <header><div><h2>Department Overview</h2><p>Distribution across key school areas</p></div></header>
        <div class="neo-donut-wrap">
          <div class="neo-donut-chart"></div>
          <ul>
            <li><i></i><span>Students</span><b>48%</b></li>
            <li><i></i><span>Academics</span><b>24%</b></li>
            <li><i></i><span>Finance</span><b>16%</b></li>
            <li><i></i><span>Operations</span><b>12%</b></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="neo-panel neo-upcoming">
        <header><div><h2>Upcoming Tasks</h2><p>Important school actions</p></div><button type="button" data-go="reports">View All</button></header>
        <ul>
          <li><b>24</b><div><strong>Attendance Review</strong><span>Today · School Office</span></div><em>Today</em></li>
          <li><b>26</b><div><strong>Fee Collection Follow-up</strong><span>Finance Department</span></div><em>Upcoming</em></li>
          <li><b>30</b><div><strong>Monthly Report</strong><span>Administration</span></div><em>Upcoming</em></li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="neo-panel neo-announcements">
        <header><div><h2>Announcements</h2><p>Latest system notices</p></div><button type="button" data-go="setting-announcement">View All</button></header>
        <div class="neo-announcement-item">${iconSvg('bell','sr-icon')}<div><strong>Welcome to the new WG System dashboard</strong><span>Your current system date and live time remain active in the header.</span></div></div>
      </article>
    </section>
  </section>`;
}
function admissionsView(){const rows=state.admissions;return `<div class="front-breadcrumb admission-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>Front Desk Registration</span><i>/</i><span>Admission Inquiry</span><button type="button" data-go="dashboard">← Back</button></div><section class="admission-panel"><header><span>▦</span><h1>Admission Inquiry</h1><button class="admission-add" data-modal="admission">✚ &nbsp;Add Inquiry</button></header><div class="admission-tools"><label>Show <select><option>10</option><option>25</option><option selected>50</option><option>100</option></select> entries</label><label>Search: <input id="admissionSearch"></label></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Phone</th><th>Date</th><th>Next Follow Up</th><th>Source</th><th>Assigned</th><th>Class</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="admissionRows">${rows.length?rows.map(a=>{const status=a.status==='Inquiry'?'Active':a.status;return `<tr><td>${esc(a.student_name)}</td><td>${esc(a.phone||'')}</td><td>${String(a.created_at||'').slice(0,10)}</td><td>${esc(a.next_follow_up||String(a.created_at||'').slice(0,10))}</td><td>${esc(a.source||'')}</td><td>${esc(a.assigned||'')}</td><td>${esc(a.requested_class||'')}</td><td><span class="admission-status-badge ${status==='Active'?'active':''}">${esc(status)}</span></td><td class="admission-action"><button type="button" class="admission-more">•••⌄</button><div class="admission-action-menu" hidden>${a.status==='Inquiry'?`<button class="admission-status" data-id="${a.id}" data-status="Assessment">Review</button>`:''}${a.status==='Assessment'?`<button class="admission-status" data-id="${a.id}" data-status="Approved">Approve</button>`:''}${a.status==='Approved'?`<button class="enroll-btn" data-id="${a.id}">Enroll Student</button>`:''}${!['Enrolled','Rejected'].includes(a.status)?`<button class="admission-status danger" data-id="${a.id}" data-status="Rejected">Reject</button>`:''}</div></td></tr>`}).join(''):'<tr><td class="empty" colspan="9">No admission inquiries yet.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div><footer><span id="admissionInfo">Showing ${rows.length?'1':'0'} to ${rows.length} of ${rows.length} ${rows.length===1?'entry':'entries'}</span><div class="front-pagination"><button disabled>Previous</button><b>1</b><button disabled>Next</button></div></footer></section>`}
function studentsView(){return `${pageHead('Students','Manage enrollment, guardians, classes, and student status.','<button class="btn secondary" id="exportBtn">⇩ Export</button><button class="btn primary" data-modal="student">＋ Add student</button>')}<section class="panel"><div class="table-tools"><input class="field" id="studentSearch" placeholder="Search students…"><select class="select" id="classFilter"><option>All classes</option><option>Grade 10 · A</option><option>Grade 9 · B</option><option>Grade 11 · A</option><option>Grade 8 · C</option></select><span id="studentCount" style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted)">${state.students.length} records</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Student</th><th>ID</th><th>Class</th><th>Guardian</th><th>Attendance</th><th>Balance</th><th>Status</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody id="studentRows">${studentRows(state.students)}</tbody></table></div></section>`}
function studentRows(list){return list.length?list.map(s=>`<tr><td><div class="student-cell"><span class="avatar">${initials(s.name)}</span><b>${s.name}</b></div></td><td>${s.id}</td><td>${s.class}</td><td>${s.guardian}<small style="display:block;color:var(--muted)">${s.phone}</small></td><td>${s.attendance}%</td><td class="${s.balance?'down':'up'}">${s.balance?money(s.balance):'Paid'}</td><td><span class="badge ${s.status==='Active'?'good':'warn'}">${s.status}</span></td><td><div class="row-actions"><button class="mini-btn" data-edit="${s.id}" title="Edit">✎</button><button class="mini-btn" data-delete="${s.id}" title="Delete">×</button></div></td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="8" class="empty">No students match the current filters.</td></tr>`}
function attendanceView(){return `${pageHead('Daily attendance','Record attendance after card scans, then review manual adjustments.','<button class="btn secondary">Today</button><button class="btn primary" id="saveAttendance">Save attendance</button>')}<section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Selected students</h2><p>Morning session · Card scans can be corrected before saving</p></div><div class="segmented"><button class="active">Morning</button><button>Afternoon</button></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="attendance-grid">${state.students.map(s=>`<div class="attendance-card" data-id="${s.id}"><span class="avatar">${initials(s.name)}</span><b>${s.name}</b><div class="segmented" style="margin-top:10px"><button class="att active" data-value="P">P</button><button class="att" data-value="L">L</button><button class="att" data-value="A">A</button></div></div>`).join('')}</div></div></section>`}
function financeView(){const due=state.students.reduce((a,s)=>a+s.balance,0);return `${pageHead('Finance','Track invoices, payments, expenses, and outstanding balances.','<button class="btn secondary">＋ Record expense</button><button class="btn primary" data-modal="payment">＋ Record payment</button>')}<div class="stats">${stat('Collected this month','$182,450','91% of monthly target','$')}${stat('Outstanding',money(due+23545),'38 student accounts','!')}${stat('Operating expenses','$86,220','↓ 3.4% vs last month','↘')}${stat('Net position','$96,230','Healthy cash position','↑')}</div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent transactions</h2><p>Latest fee payments and adjustments</p></div><span class="badge good">Reconciled</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Receipt</th><th>Student</th><th>Category</th><th>Date</th><th>Method</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[['RC-8821','Maya Chen','Tuition','Aug 18','Card','$1,250'],['RC-8820','Noah Williams','Transport','Aug 18','Bank','$320'],['RC-8819','Sofia Patel','Tuition','Aug 17','Cash','$1,250'],['RC-8818','Ethan Kim','Activities','Aug 17','Card','$180']].map(x=>`<tr>${x.map(y=>`<td>${y}</td>`).join('')}<td><span class="badge good">Paid</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div></section>`}
function scheduleView(){const times=['08:00','09:00','10:15','11:15','13:00','14:00'];const subjects=['Mathematics','English','Biology','History','Computer Science','Arts'];return `${pageHead('Master schedule','Weekly timetable for Grade 10 · A.','<button class="btn secondary">⇩ Export</button><button class="btn primary">＋ Add lesson</button>')}<section class="panel"><div class="table-tools"><select class="select"><option>Grade 10 · A</option><option>Grade 9 · B</option></select><select class="select"><option>Week of Aug 17</option></select></div><div class="panel-body" style="overflow:auto"><div class="schedule"><div class="day"></div>${['Monday','Tuesday','Wednesday','Thursday','Friday'].map(x=>`<div class="day">${x}</div>`).join('')}${times.map((t,r)=>`<div>${t}</div>${[0,1,2,3,4].map((_,c)=>`<div class="lesson ${(r+c)%3===1?'alt':''}"><b>${subjects[(r+c)%subjects.length]}</b><small style="display:block;margin-top:4px">Room ${201+r}</small></div>`).join('')}`).join('')}</div></div></section>`}
function aiView(){return `${pageHead('AI Operations','Use a current model to summarize, draft, analyze, and automate school workflows.','<button class="btn secondary" id="clearChat">Clear chat</button>')}<div class="ai-layout"><section class="panel ai-config"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Assistant configuration</h2><p>API-ready model settings</p></div><span class="badge good">Ready</span></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="form-group"><label>Provider</label><select><option>OpenAI</option><option>Anthropic</option><option>Google</option><option>Local / Ollama</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Model</label><select id="modelSelect"><option>Latest capable model</option><option>Fast reasoning model</option><option>Local private model</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Data access</label><select><option>Operational summaries</option><option>De-identified records only</option><option>No student data</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label>Quick workflows</label><div class="quick-grid"><button class="quick" data-prompt="Summarize today's attendance risks">Attendance risks</button><button class="quick" data-prompt="Draft payment reminders for overdue accounts">Payment reminders</button><button class="quick" data-prompt="Find schedule conflicts this week">Schedule conflicts</button><button class="quick" data-prompt="Create a weekly leadership brief">Leadership brief</button></div></div><small style="color:var(--muted)">Connect a server-side API key before production use. Never expose provider keys in browser code.</small></div></section><section class="panel ai-chat"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Northstar Assistant</h2><p>Context: Riverside Academy · 2026–2027</p></div><span class="badge">Human review required</span></div><div class="messages" id="messages"><div class="message">I can help analyze attendance, finance, schedules, and school operations. Choose a workflow or ask a question.</div>${state.messages.map(m=>`<div class="message ${m.role}">${m.text}</div>`).join('')}</div><div class="composer"><input class="field" id="aiInput" placeholder="Ask about school operations…"><button class="btn primary" id="aiSend">Send</button></div></section></div>`}
function reportsView(){return `${pageHead('Reports','Operational reporting across academics, finance, and people.','<button class="btn primary" id="downloadReport">⇩ Download report</button>')}<div class="stats">${stat('Enrollment growth','4.2%','52 net new students','↑')}${stat('Attendance rate','94.6%','Target: 95%','✓')}${stat('Fee collection','91.0%','Target: 94%','$')}${stat('Pass rate','89.4%','↑ 2.6 points','◇')}</div><div class="grid-2"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Academic performance</h2><p>Average score by subject</p></div></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="chart">${[84,78,91,74,88,82].map((h,i)=>`<div class="bar-wrap"><strong>${h}%</strong><div class="bar ${i%2?'alt':''}" style="height:${h-25}%"></div><span>${['Math','English','Science','History','Computing','Arts'][i]}</span></div>`).join('')}</div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Leadership snapshot</h2></div><div class="panel-body"><div class="kpi-row" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><div class="kpi"><b>12</b><small>Students need attendance intervention</small></div><div class="kpi"><b>38</b><small>Overdue fee accounts</small></div><div class="kpi"><b>3</b><small>Open staffing requirements</small></div><div class="kpi"><b>97%</b><small>Parent portal activation</small></div></div></div></section></div>`}
