function studentAdmissionView(){const sections=['Tuition Information','Other Fee','DayCare Fee','Car Fee','Material Payment Infomation'],choices={gender:['Male','Female'],program:['General Education','English Program','Khmer Program'],class:['KGE-K1','KGE-K2','BP-S1','BP-K2'],time:['Morning','Afternoon','Evening'],room:['Room 1','Room 2','Room 3']},selectOptions=name=>(choices[name]||[]).map(value=>`<option>${value}</option>`).join('');return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>Student Information</span><i>/</i><span>Student Admission</span></div><form id="studentAdmissionForm" class="student-admission-page"><section class="panel admission-student-info"><div class="panel-head"><h2>${iconSvg('user','section-icon')} Student Information</h2></div><div class="panel-body admission-info-grid"><label class="student-photo-field"><span class="student-photo-title">Student Photo</span><div class="student-photo-preview" id="studentPhotoPreview">${iconSvg('user','student-photo-placeholder-icon')}</div><input type="file" id="studentPhotoInput" name="photo_file" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp"><span class="student-photo-file-row"><b id="studentPhotoFileName">Choose File</b><small>No file chosen</small></span><span class="student-photo-help">Upload Student Profile Image</span><input type="hidden" name="photo" id="studentPhotoData"></label>${[['Student Name (Khmer)','name_khmer','text',true],['Student Name (English)','name_english','text',true],['Student Name (Chinese)','name_chinese','text',false],['Admission Date','admission_date','date',true],['Gender','gender','select',true],['Main Contact','phone','text',true],['Date of Birth','birth_date','date',false],['Father Name','father_name','text',false],['Father Phone','father_phone','text',false],['Father Occupation','father_occupation','text',false],['Mother Name','mother_name','text',false],['Mother Phone','mother_phone','text',false],['Mother Occupation','mother_occupation','text',false],['Guardian Name','guardian_name','text',false],['Guardian Relation','guardian_relation','text',false],['Guardian Phone','guardian_phone','text',false],['Guardian Occupation','guardian_occupation','text',false],['Program','program','select',false],['Class','class','select',false],['Time','time','select',false],['Room','room','select',false]].map(([label,name,type,required])=>`<label>${label}${required?' <em>*</em>':''}${type==='select'?`<select name="${name}" ${required?'required':''}><option value="">Select</option>${selectOptions(name)}</select>`:`<input type="${type}" name="${name}" ${required?'required':''}>`}</label>`).join('')}</div></section>${sections.map((name,index)=>`<section class="panel admission-fee-section"><div class="panel-head"><h2>${name}</h2><button type="button" class="btn admission-fee-add" data-admission-section="${index}">Add</button></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>${index===4?'ID':'Fee Item'}</th><th>${index===4?'Category':'Start Date'}</th><th>${index===4?'Item':'Expiry Date'}</th>${index===3||index===4?'<th>Unit</th>':''}<th>Amount ($)</th><th>Discount(%)</th><th>Discount($)</th><th>Total($)</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody data-admission-fees="${index}">${studentAdmissionFeeRow(index)}</tbody><tfoot><tr><th colspan="${index===3||index===4?4:3}">Total:</th><th>$ 0</th><th>0%</th><th>$ 0</th><th class="admission-section-total">$ 0.00</th><th></th></tr></tfoot></table></div></section>`).join('')}<section class="panel admission-payment"><div class="panel-head"><h2>▣ Payment Details</h2></div><div class="panel-body admission-payment-grid"><label>Payment Date <em>*</em><input type="date" name="payment_date" required value="${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}"></label><label>Payment Type <em>*</em><select name="payment_type" required><option>Cash</option><option>Bank</option><option>Card</option></select></label><label>Currency <em>*</em><select name="currency" required><option>USD</option><option>KHR</option></select></label><label>Amount <em>*</em><input id="admissionGrandTotal" name="amount" readonly value="0.00"></label><label>Amount (Exchange)<input type="number" name="amount_exchange" step=".01" value="0"></label><label class="wide">Note<textarea name="note" rows="3"></textarea></label><div class="wide admission-submit-actions"><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="clearAdmission">Clear Selected</button><button type="button" class="btn secondary" id="previewAdmission">Preview Invoice</button><button type="submit" class="btn primary">Save and Print</button></div></div></section></form>`}
function studentAdmissionFeeRow(section){return `<tr><td><input class="admission-fee-name" value="${['Tuition Fee','Other Fee','DayCare Fee','Car Fee','Material'][section]}"></td><td><input type="${section===4?'text':'date'}"></td><td><input type="${section===4?'text':'date'}"></td>${section===3||section===4?'<td><input type="number" value="1" min="1"></td>':''}<td><input type="number" class="admission-fee-amount" min="0" step=".01" value="0"></td><td><input type="number" class="admission-fee-percent" min="0" max="100" step=".01" value="0"></td><td><input type="number" class="admission-fee-discount" min="0" step=".01" value="0"></td><td><input class="admission-fee-total" value="0.00" readonly></td><td><button type="button" class="btn danger admission-fee-delete">Delete</button></td></tr>`}
function bindStudentAdmission(){const form=$('#studentAdmissionForm');if(!form)return;const photoInput=$('#studentPhotoInput'),photoPreview=$('#studentPhotoPreview'),photoData=$('#studentPhotoData'),photoName=$('#studentPhotoFileName');if(photoInput&&!photoInput.dataset.bound){photoInput.dataset.bound='1';photoInput.onchange=()=>{const file=photoInput.files&&photoInput.files[0];if(!file)return;if(!/^image\/(jpeg|png|webp)$/i.test(file.type)){photoInput.value='';return toast('Student photo must be JPG, PNG or WEBP')}if(file.size>3*1024*1024){photoInput.value='';return toast('Student photo must be 3 MB or smaller')}const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>{photoData.value=String(reader.result||'');photoPreview.innerHTML=`<img src="${photoData.value}" alt="Student photo preview">`;photoName.textContent=file.name;const small=photoName.parentElement?.querySelector('small');if(small)small.textContent='Selected'};reader.readAsDataURL(file)}}const resetPhoto=()=>{if(photoInput)photoInput.value='';if(photoData)photoData.value='';if(photoPreview)photoPreview.innerHTML=iconSvg('user','student-photo-placeholder-icon');if(photoName)photoName.textContent='Choose File';const small=photoName?.parentElement?.querySelector('small');if(small)small.textContent='No file chosen'};const calculate=()=>{let grand=0;document.querySelectorAll('[data-admission-fees]').forEach(body=>{let sectionTotal=0;body.querySelectorAll('tr').forEach(row=>{const amount=Number(row.querySelector('.admission-fee-amount').value)||0,percent=Number(row.querySelector('.admission-fee-percent').value)||0,discount=Number(row.querySelector('.admission-fee-discount').value)||0,total=Math.max(0,amount-amount*percent/100-discount);row.querySelector('.admission-fee-total').value=total.toFixed(2);sectionTotal+=total});body.closest('table').querySelector('.admission-section-total').textContent=money(sectionTotal);grand+=sectionTotal});$('#admissionGrandTotal').value=grand.toFixed(2);form.dataset.total=grand};form.oninput=calculate;document.querySelectorAll('.admission-fee-add').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{document.querySelector(`[data-admission-fees="${button.dataset.admissionSection}"]`).insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',studentAdmissionFeeRow(Number(button.dataset.admissionSection)));bindStudentAdmission();calculate()});document.querySelectorAll('.admission-fee-delete').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{const body=button.closest('tbody');if(body.rows.length>1)button.closest('tr').remove();else button.closest('tr').querySelectorAll('input[type=number]').forEach(input=>input.value=input.min==='1'?'1':'0');calculate()});$('#clearAdmission').onclick=()=>{form.reset();resetPhoto();calculate()};$('#previewAdmission').onclick=()=>toast(`Student invoice preview · ${money(Number(form.dataset.total)||0)}`);form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(form),data=Object.fromEntries(fd),name=(data.name_english||data.name_khmer||'').trim(),student={id:`ST-${Date.now().toString().slice(-7)}`,name,name_khmer:data.name_khmer||'',name_english:data.name_english||'',name_chinese:data.name_chinese||'',class:data.class||'Unassigned',program:data.program||'',time:data.time||'',room:data.room||'',gender:data.gender||'',birth_date:data.birth_date||'',admission_date:data.admission_date||'',guardian:data.guardian_name||data.father_name||data.mother_name||name,guardian_relation:data.guardian_relation||'',guardian_phone:data.guardian_phone||'',guardian_occupation:data.guardian_occupation||'',father_name:data.father_name||'',father_phone:data.father_phone||'',father_occupation:data.father_occupation||'',mother_name:data.mother_name||'',mother_phone:data.mother_phone||'',mother_occupation:data.mother_occupation||'',phone:data.phone||data.guardian_phone||'',photo:data.photo||'',status:'Active',balance:0,attendance:100};if(!name)return toast('Enter the student name');try{if(state.server)await api('student',student);state.students.unshift(student);const total=Number(form.dataset.total)||0;if(total>0&&state.server)await api('payment',{student:student.id,category:'Admission fees',amount:total,method:data.payment_type||'Cash'});persist();await refreshServer();toast('Student admitted and invoice prepared');navigate('students')}catch(error){toast(error.message)}};calculate()}

function accountingSetupView(){state.accountingTab??='accounting-income-type';const tabs=[['accounting-income-type','Type of Income'],['accounting-expense-type','Type of Expense'],['accounting-chart','Chart of Account']],active=tabs.find(tab=>tab[0]===state.accountingTab)||tabs[0],key=active[0],rows=state.records[key]||[],expense=key==='accounting-expense-type',chart=key==='accounting-chart',columns=chart?['No','Name','Code','Type']:expense?['ID','Expense Name','Asset','Expense']:['ID','Name','Asset','Income'],buttonLabel=expense?'Add Type':'Create New',crumb=chart?'Chart Of Account':expense?'Expense Type':'Income Type';return `<div class="front-breadcrumb accounting-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>◉ ${crumb}</span>${chart?'':`<i>/</i><span>⚙ ${crumb}</span>`}</div><div class="accounting-setup-layout"><aside class="accounting-setup-menu"><h3>⚙ Account Set Up</h3>${tabs.map(([tabKey,label])=>`<button type="button" data-account-tab="${tabKey}" class="${tabKey===key?'active':''}">» &nbsp;${label}</button>`).join('')}</aside><section class="accounting-setup-panel"><div class="accounting-toolbar"><button type="button" id="accountingCreate">✚ ${buttonLabel}</button>${chart?'<button type="button" id="accountingExcel">▧ Excel</button>':''}<span>🔧⌄</span><label>Search <input id="accountingSearch"></label></div><form id="accountingSetupForm" data-key="${key}" data-mode="${chart?'chart':expense?'expense':'income'}" hidden><input type="hidden" name="_id">${chart?'<label>Name <em>*</em><input name="Name" required></label><label>Code <em>*</em><input name="Code" required></label><label>Type <em>*</em><select name="Type" required><option>Asset</option><option>Liability</option><option>Income</option><option>Expense</option><option>Equity</option></select></label>':`<label>${expense?'Expense Name':'Name'} <em>*</em><input name="${expense?'Expense Name':'Name'}" required></label><label class="account-check"><input type="checkbox" name="Asset" value="Yes"> Asset</label><label class="account-check"><input type="checkbox" name="${expense?'Expense':'Income'}" value="Yes"> ${expense?'Expense':'Income'}</label>`}<div><button type="button" id="accountingCancel">Cancel</button><button type="submit">Save</button></div></form><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr>${columns.map(column=>`<th>${column}</th>`).join('')}<th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="accountingSetupRows">${rows.length?rows.map((row,index)=>`<tr data-id="${row.id}">${columns.map((column,columnIndex)=>`<td>${columnIndex===0?index+1:esc(row[column]||'No')}</td>`).join('')}<td><button type="button" class="accounting-edit" data-id="${row.id}">Edit</button><button type="button" class="accounting-delete" data-id="${row.id}">Delete</button></td></tr>`).join(''):`<tr><td colspan="${columns.length+1}" class="empty">No records found.</td></tr>`}</tbody></table></div><footer>Page 1 Of 1</footer></section></div>`}
function bindAccountingSetup(){const form=$('#accountingSetupForm');if(!form)return;document.querySelectorAll('[data-account-tab]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{state.accountingTab=button.dataset.accountTab;render()});const open=(record=null)=>{form.reset();form.hidden=false;$('#accountingCreate').hidden=true;if(record){form.elements._id.value=record.id;[...form.elements].forEach(input=>{if(!input.name||input.name==='_id')return;if(input.type==='checkbox')input.checked=record[input.name]==='Yes';else input.value=record[input.name]||input.value})}form.querySelector('input:not([type=hidden])')?.focus()};$('#accountingCreate').onclick=()=>open();$('#accountingCancel').onclick=()=>{form.reset();form.hidden=true;$('#accountingCreate').hidden=false};document.querySelectorAll('.accounting-edit').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>open((state.records[form.dataset.key]||[]).find(row=>String(row.id)===button.dataset.id)));document.querySelectorAll('.accounting-delete').forEach(button=>button.onclick=async()=>{if(!confirm('Delete this account record?'))return;try{if(state.server)await api('delete-workflow',{workflow:form.dataset.key,id:button.dataset.id});state.records[form.dataset.key]=(state.records[form.dataset.key]||[]).filter(row=>String(row.id)!==button.dataset.id);persist();render();toast('Record deleted')}catch(error){toast(error.message)}});form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form)),id=data._id||'';delete data._id;if(form.dataset.mode!=='chart'){data.Asset=data.Asset||'No';const typeField=form.dataset.mode==='expense'?'Expense':'Income';data[typeField]=data[typeField]||'No'}try{let savedId=id||String(Date.now());if(state.server){const result=await api('workflow',{workflow:form.dataset.key,id,payload:data});savedId=result.id}state.records[form.dataset.key]??=[];const found=state.records[form.dataset.key].find(row=>String(row.id)===String(id));if(found)Object.assign(found,data,{id:savedId});else state.records[form.dataset.key].unshift({id:savedId,...data});persist();render();toast(id?'Record updated':'Record saved')}catch(error){toast(error.message)}};$('#accountingSearch').oninput=e=>document.querySelectorAll('#accountingSetupRows tr').forEach(row=>row.hidden=!row.textContent.toLowerCase().includes(e.target.value.toLowerCase()));if($('#accountingExcel'))$('#accountingExcel').onclick=()=>{const rows=state.records['accounting-chart']||[],csv=['Name,Code,Type',...rows.map(row=>`"${row.Name||''}","${row.Code||''}","${row.Type||''}"`)].join('\n'),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([csv],{type:'text/csv'}));a.download='chart-of-account.csv';a.click();URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href)}}
function accountingOperationView(){state.accountingOperationTab??='journal';const tabs=[['journal','Journal Entry'],['income','Income List'],['expense','Expense List'],['gl','GL Transaction']],active=tabs.find(tab=>tab[0]===state.accountingOperationTab)||tabs[0];if(active[0]!=='journal'){const rows=state.records['accounting-journal']||[],filtered=active[0]==='gl'?rows:rows.filter(row=>String(row['Operation Type']||'').toLowerCase().includes(active[0]));return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>⚙ Accounting Operation</span><i>/</i><span>${active[1]}</span><button data-go="dashboard">← Back</button></div><div class="accounting-operation-layout">${accountingOperationMenu(tabs,active[0])}<section class="accounting-operation-list"><header><h1>${active[1]}</h1></header><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Receipt No</th><th>Operation Type</th><th>Currency</th><th>Total Debit</th><th>Total Credit</th></tr></thead><tbody>${filtered.length?filtered.map(row=>`<tr><td>${esc(row.Date||'')}</td><td>${esc(row['Receipt No']||'')}</td><td>${esc(row['Operation Type']||'')}</td><td>${esc(row.Currency||'USD')}</td><td>${money(row['Total Debit']||0)}</td><td>${money(row['Total Credit']||0)}</td></tr>`).join(''):'<tr><td colspan="6" class="empty">No transactions found.</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section></div>`}return `<div class="front-breadcrumb"><span>⌂ Dashboard</span><i>/</i><span>⚙ Accounting Operation</span><i>/</i><span>✚ Journal Entry Batch</span><button data-go="dashboard">← Back</button></div><div class="accounting-operation-layout">${accountingOperationMenu(tabs,active[0])}<form id="journalForm" class="journal-panel"><div class="journal-header-fields"><label>Date<input type="date" name="Date" required value="${new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10)}"></label><label>Currency<select name="Currency"><option>USD</option><option>KHR</option></select></label><label>Operation Type<select name="Operation Type" required><option value="">Select</option><option>Income</option><option>Expense</option><option>General</option></select></label><label>Receipt No<input name="Receipt No"></label><label class="wide">Note<textarea name="Note" rows="2"></textarea></label></div><div class="journal-lines"><div class="journal-line-head"><b>Account Name</b><b>Note</b><b>Debit ($)</b><b>Credit ($)</b><b>Action</b></div><div id="journalRows">${journalRow()}</div></div><div class="journal-totals"><b>Total Debit : $ <span id="journalDebit">0.00</span></b><b>Total Credit : $ <span id="journalCredit">0.00</span></b></div><footer><button type="submit">▮ Save</button></footer></form></div>`}
function accountingOperationMenu(tabs,active){return `<aside class="accounting-operation-menu"><h3>⚙ Accounting Operation</h3>${tabs.map(([key,label])=>`<button type="button" data-operation-tab="${key}" class="${key===active?'active':''}">» &nbsp;${label}</button>`).join('')}</aside>`}
function journalRow(){const accounts=[...(state.records['accounting-income-type']||[]),...(state.records['accounting-expense-type']||[]),...(state.records['accounting-chart']||[])],names=[...new Set(accounts.map(row=>row.Name||row['Expense Name']).filter(Boolean))];return `<div class="journal-line"><select class="journal-account" required><option value="">Select account</option>${names.map(name=>`<option>${esc(name)}</option>`).join('')}</select><input class="journal-note"><input type="number" class="journal-debit" min="0" step=".01" value="0"><input type="number" class="journal-credit" min="0" step=".01" value="0"><div><button type="button" class="journal-add">Add</button><button type="button" class="journal-delete">▥</button></div></div>`}
function bindAccountingOperation(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-operation-tab]').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{state.accountingOperationTab=button.dataset.operationTab;render()});const form=$('#journalForm');if(!form)return;const calculate=()=>{let debit=0,credit=0;document.querySelectorAll('.journal-line').forEach(row=>{debit+=Number(row.querySelector('.journal-debit').value)||0;credit+=Number(row.querySelector('.journal-credit').value)||0});$('#journalDebit').textContent=debit.toFixed(2);$('#journalCredit').textContent=credit.toFixed(2);form.dataset.debit=debit;form.dataset.credit=credit};const bindLines=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.journal-add').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{$('#journalRows').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',journalRow());bindLines();calculate()});document.querySelectorAll('.journal-delete').forEach(button=>button.onclick=()=>{if(document.querySelectorAll('.journal-line').length>1)button.closest('.journal-line').remove();else button.closest('.journal-line').querySelectorAll('input').forEach(input=>input.value=input.type==='number'?'0':'');calculate()})};form.oninput=calculate;bindLines();form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const debit=Number(form.dataset.debit)||0,credit=Number(form.dataset.credit)||0;if(debit<=0&&credit<=0)return toast('Enter a debit or credit amount');if(Math.abs(debit-credit)>.001)return toast('Total debit and credit must be equal');const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));data['Total Debit']=debit;data['Total Credit']=credit;data.Lines=[...document.querySelectorAll('.journal-line')].map(row=>({account:row.querySelector('.journal-account').value,note:row.querySelector('.journal-note').value,debit:row.querySelector('.journal-debit').value,credit:row.querySelector('.journal-credit').value}));try{let id=String(Date.now());if(state.server){const result=await api('workflow',{workflow:'accounting-journal',id:'',payload:data});id=result.id}state.records['accounting-journal']??=[];state.records['accounting-journal'].unshift({id,...data});persist();if(state.server)await refreshServer();toast('Journal entry saved');render()}catch(error){toast(error.message)}};calculate()}
